sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant CFN as CloudFormation
    participant ECR as ECR
    participant SSM as Parameter Store
    participant L as Lambda (blog, mcp, agent)
    participant S3 as S3
    participant CF as CloudFront

    Dev->>GH: git push origin main
    GH->>CFN: DescribeStacks (function names, bucket, distribution)
    GH->>GH: docker build blog-app and agent-chat
    GH->>ECR: push blog:sha and agent:sha
    GH->>SSM: PutParameter OPENAI_API_KEY, LANGSMITH_* (from repo secrets and variables)
    GH->>L: UpdateFunctionCode blog, mcp (blog image), agent
    L-->>GH: LastUpdateStatus Successful
    GH->>GH: npm build blog UI (/api/blog) and chat UI (base /chat/)
    GH->>S3: sync assets (immutable), index.html (no-cache)
    GH->>CF: CreateInvalidation /index.html, /chat/index.html
    GH-->>Dev: job summary with the live URLs
